ρ = 0.78 is hand-typed in `slides/manuscript/main.tex` (§4 site, ~line
646 "the inaccurate models are also the unreliable ones (Spearman
ρ = 0.78", and an annex range "ρ = 0.78--0.80" ~line 1939). No macro for
it exists in `macros_manuscript.tex`. Same defect class as the pooled
ρ = 0.92 that 0566 just converted (rule 0531,
