Related: 0575 covers the remaining hand-typed exp2 cost/row-count
medians; 0576 covers tie handling in the `_spearman` estimator (touch
that first or together if it shifts the 2dp value).

## Actions

1. Identify the script that computes the coherence–F1 correlation
   (the §4 coherence analysis) and the committed artifact holding it;
